            <docset:TenantName dg:origin="1 268 346 1775 377">United Colonies Commissary, an <docset:TenantEntityType dg:origin="1 732 346 1775 377">administrative agency of the United Nations Martian Administration (UNMA)</docset:TenantEntityType>
